WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Locate. A coordinate pair tells the map where to look: longitude first, latitude second.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Layer. Vector places and raster elevations answer different questions about the same map.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Inspect. Display the map and compare a point with the raster beneath it.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Preserve. Keep the recipe so the source addresses and styling remain inspectable.
